        <mxCell id="QAcrxbEmZHklEk5tCTiz-46" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Select Lap - User can select different lap to compare the performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Save -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Save the point for note taking and reference where the graph stop running&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Point - Point on the graph where highlight the important part&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The graph can be hide if click the name of the chart&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Note - Double click the note column to start writing. user can type the notes inside the column and save it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Once user click save button,&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;the word&#39;s color will fade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;The graph X-axis is the total distance of the track, Y-axis is the value of time, gas, brake, speed and temperature/pressure respectively&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;movable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;" parent="5qMhN-JXeM-rMtUGRVOr-1" vertex="1">
